A -> C
C -> Goal

Minimum Total Travel Cost: 6
Result

The Bellman equation was successfully implemented for the autonomous delivery robot, and the optimal path with minimum total travel cost was determined as Start → A → C → Goal, with a minimum travel cost of 6.
